   "notes": "Key image prints C (read correctly), but (1-x)^2/(1+x^2)^2 = 1/(1+x^2) - 2x/(1+x^2)^2 = f+f1 with f=1/(1+x^2), so integral = e^x/(1+x^2)+C = option A; differentiating C gives a different result; printed key looks erroneous.",
